{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act52side_level_act52side_07_beg","storyGroup":"act52side","storySort":15,"storyDependence":"act52side_level_act52side_06_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"YW-7","storyName":"殉葬品","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"卡门从德·托莱多的陈述中锁定了抹去港都坐标的真凶；克莱门莎在打捞中心与奥卢斯正面交锋。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act52side/level_act52side_07_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act52side_07_beg","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":13,"next":15,"characters":["塔西塔","克莱门莎","惩戒军士官","惩戒军新兵","艾丽妮","特菲","沉稳的男声","圣徒卡门","奥卢斯","？？？"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_bg_74_g6_gdsquare_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"克莱门莎监事！","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"塔西塔，打捞中心情况如何？","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"打捞中心的所有权限都被封锁了，所有工作人员都无法进入。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"封锁不是通过阿戈尔为打捞中心设计的系统实现的，而是借由一种更古老、更基础的指令，或许只有港都的设计者才会使用。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"奥卢斯……","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"灯塔遇袭之前，我在系统里留过后门，或许我有办法覆写指令，恢复权限，解除对打捞中心的封锁。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我会立刻赶往打捞中心，但岸上的情况也不乐观。审判庭抓捕岛民的行动必然受到了阻碍，纳乔已经去找他四散的岛民同胞了，你——","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"我也会去安抚我们的同胞。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"看来旁听审问让你的思考得出了结论。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"其实现在还没有……但如果我理解得没错，参与互助会的岛民们的诉求本就不尽相同。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"哪怕他们现在挟持了港都中心城区，但承认国民身份、对冤假错案公开道歉，真的就能满足所有岛民吗？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"在阿戈尔的通识教育里，岛民是一个整体，在伊比利亚的认知中或许也是如此。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"但我见过阿奎拉，见过纳乔，哪怕我只认识打捞中心的几十名岛民，我也明白他们每个人都是不同的，每个人都有自己的选择。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"我无法像您一样下定决心去帮助他们，但我也有自己的课题。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"而且说不定这样，能从他们口中得知关于中心城区去向的线索。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我很期待听到你的结论，塔西塔，去做吧。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"是！","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":48},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.2","id":50},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":51},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":52},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block"